{"v":[[1,"Judge me, O Lord; for I have walked in mine integrity: I have trusted also in the Lord; therefore I shall not slide."],[2,"Examine me, O Lord, and prove me; try my reins and my heart."],[3,"For thy lovingkindness is before mine eyes: and I have walked in thy truth."],[4,"I have not sat with vain persons, neither will I go in with dissemblers."],[5,"I have hated the congregation of evil doers; and will not sit with the wicked."],[6,"I will wash mine hands in innocency: so will I compass thine altar, O Lord:"],[7,"That I may publish with the voice of thanksgiving, and tell of all thy wondrous works."],[8,"Lord, I have loved the habitation of thy house, and the place where thine honour dwelleth."],[9,"Gather not my soul with sinners, nor my life with bloody men:"],[10,"In whose hands is mischief, and their right hand is full of bribes."],[11,"But as for me, I will walk in mine integrity: redeem me, and be merciful unto me."],[12,"My foot standeth in an even place: in the congregations will I bless the Lord."]],"w":{"1":[["shafete-ni","vindicate me","H8199"],["yahweh","O Yahweh","H3068"],["ki","for","H3588"],["'ani","I","H589"],["be-tum-i","in integrity my","H8537"],["halakhti","I have walked","H1980"],["vu-ba-yahweh","and in Yahweh","H3068"],["batachti","I have trusted","H982"],["lo'","not","H3808"],["'em'ad","I will slip","H4571"]],"2":[["bechane-ni","test me","H974"],["yahweh","O Yahweh","H3068"],["ve-nase-ni","and put to [the] test me","H5254"],["tzarefa-h","test !","H6884"],["khilyota-i","kidneys my","H3629"],["ve-lib-i","and heart my","H3820"]],"3":[["ki","for","H3588"],["chasde-kha","covenant loyalty your","H2617"],["le-neged","[is] to before","H5048"],["'eina-i","eyes my","H5869"],["ve-hithalakhti","and I walk about","H1980"],["ba-'amite-kha","in faithfulness your","H571"]],"4":[["lo'","not","H3808"],["yashavti","I sit","H3427"],["'im","with","H5973"],["metei","men of","H4962"],["shav'","falsehood","H7723"],["ve-'im","and with","H5973"],["na'alamim","[